  "id": "spinach-bacon-and-ham-quiche",
  "name": "Spinach, Bacon, and Ham Quiche",
  "subtitle": "A savory two-crust quiche with greens, mushrooms, ham, and three cheeses.",
  "description": "Two unbaked crusts are filled with sautéed vegetables, bacon, ham, cheese, and a seasoned egg custard, then baked until golden and fully set.",
